### Day 9 Exercise 5 - Authentication Test Evidence
### Run the app first: mvn spring-boot:run
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080


### ============================================================
### 1. Health endpoint is public (expect 200)
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health


### ============================================================
### 2. Ticket endpoint WITHOUT token (expect 401 Unauthorized)
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets


### ============================================================
### 3. Register a new user (expect 201 + token with role USER)
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test@12345"
}


### ============================================================
### 4. Login the registered user (expect 200 + token)
### Copy the token value from the response body
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test@12345"
}


### ============================================================
### 5. Ticket endpoint WITH user token (expect 200 OK)
### Replace PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE with the token from step 3 or 4
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE


### ============================================================
### 6. Create ticket with normal USER token (expect 403 Forbidden)
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Network issue",
  "description": "WiFi keeps disconnecting on Level 3.",
  "category": "Network",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "createdBy": "testuser@example.com"
}


### ============================================================
### 7. Login seeded admin user (expect 200 + token with role ADMIN)
### Seeded credentials: admin@example.com / Admin@12345
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}


### ============================================================
### 8. Create ticket with ADMIN token (expect 201 Created)
### Replace PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE with the token from step 7
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Server maintenance",
  "description": "Scheduled maintenance for production server.",
  "category": "Infrastructure",
  "priority": "Medium",
  "createdBy": "admin@example.com"
}
